 target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open SCP Study ↗</a></div></header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n  <section class=\"filters\" aria-label=\"Dashboard filters\">\n    <div class=\"field cohort\"><label for=\"cohort\">Cohort</label><select id=\"cohort\"><option value=\"\">All cohorts</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field mode\"><label for=\"mode\">Mode</label><select id=\"mode\"><option value=\"\">Study + Test</option><option value=\"study\">Study</option><option value=\"test\">Practice test</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field country\"><label for=\"country\">Country</label><select id=\"country\"><option value=\"\">All countries</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field region\"><label for=\"region\">Region</label><select id=\"region\"><option value=\"\">All regions</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field city\"><label for=\"city\">City</label><select id=\"city\"><option value=\"\">All cities</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field category\"><label for=\"category\">Topic</label><select id=\"category\"><option value=\"\">All topics</option></select></div>\n    <div class=\"field from\"><label for=\"from\">From</label><input id=\"from\" type=\"date\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"field to\"><label for=\"to\">Through</label><input id=\"to\" type=\"date\" /></div>\n    <button class=\"clear\" id=\"clearFilters\" type=\"button\">Clear filters</button>\n  </section>\n  <div id=\"error\" class=\"error hidden\"></div>\n  <div class=\"meta\"><span id=\"filterSummary\">All recorded activity</span><div class=\"meta-actions\"><span id=\"updated\">Loading…</span><button class=\"refresh\" id=\"refreshData\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Refresh dashboard data\">↻ Refresh</button></div></div>\n  <section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"></section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div class=\"headcopy\"><h2>Needs review</h2><span>Questions combining low first-attempt accuracy with slow responses or concentrated distractors</span></div></div><div id=\"needsReview\"></div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div class=\"headcopy\"><h2>Topic heat map</h2><span>Performance, recovery, response time, and study-aid usage by topic</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#f5c9cf\"></i>Needs attention</span><span><i class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#caecd9\"></i>Stronger</span></div></div><div id=\"heatmap\"></div></section>\n\n  <div class=\"grid2\">\n    <section class=\"section\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div class=\"headcopy\"><h2>Topics needing review</h2><span>Sample sizes shown with every result</span></div><div class=\"section-actions\"><select id=\"topicsSort\" class=\"sort-select\" aria-label=\"Sort topics\"><option value=\"hardest\">Hardest first</option><option value=\"attempts\">Most attempted</option><option value=\"learners\">Most learners</option><option value=\"improved\">Most improved</option><option value=\"audio\">Most audio use</option></select></div></div><div id=\"topics\"></div></section>\n    <section class=\"section\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div class=\"headcopy\"><h2>Where students are studying</h2><span>IP-derived, approximate</span></div></div><div id=\"locations\"></div></section>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div class=\"headcopy\"><h2>Question diagnostics</h2><span>Tap any question for answer distribution and detailed metrics</span></div><div class=\"section-actions\"><select id=\"questionsSort\" class=\"sort-select\" aria-label=\"Sort questions\"><option value=\"hardest\">Hardest first</option><option value=\"attempts\">Most attempted</option><option value=\"slowest\">Slowest responses</option><option value=\"improved\">Most improved</option><option value=\"distractor\">Strongest distractor</option></select></div></div><div id=\"questions\"></div></section>\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div class=\"headcopy\"><h2>Activity over time</h2><span>Daily answer volume and peak study times in each student’s local timezone</span></div></div><div class=\"activity-grid\"><div class=\"activity-panel\"><h3>Answer submissions by day</h3><span class=\"activity-sub\">Up to the most recent 90 days in the selected filters</span><div id=\"timeline\"></div></div><div class=\"activity-panel\"><h3>Peak study times</h3><span class=\"activity-sub\">Local clock time at each student’s approximate network timezone</span><div id=\"peakTimes\"></div></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<footer class=\"foot\">“Learners” means unique anonymous app installations, so it is an estimate rather than a verified student count. First-attempt accuracy uses attempts the app identifies as the first attempt on that installation. “Eventually correct” means the learner got the question correct at least once among recorded attempts. Location is inferred by Cloudflare from the network request; SCP Study does not request GPS and this dashboard does not expose anonymous installation IDs or raw event rows.</footer>\n<dialog id=\"questionDialog\" aria-labelledby=\"questionDialogTitle\"><div class=\"modal-head\"><div ><h2 id=\"questionDialogTitle\">Question details</h2><p id=\"questionDialogSubtitle\"></p></div><button class=\"modal-close\" id=\"closeQuestionDialog\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close\">×</button></div><div class=\"modal-body\" id=\"questionDialogBody\"></div></dialog>\n<script>\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);let options=null,catalog=new Map(),busy=false,currentData=null,toastTimer=null;const filters=['cohort','country','region','city','category','mode','from','to'];const bucketOrder={'<10s':0,'10–29':1,'30–59s':2,'1–2m':3,'2–5m':4,'5m+':5};\nfunction esc(v){return String(v??'').replace(/[&<>\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c]))}\nfunction pct(n,d){return d?`${(100*n/d).toFixed(d<10?0:1)}%`:'—'}\nfunction ratio(n,d){return d?n/d:0}\nfunction pctClass(n,d){if(!d)return'';const p=100*n/d;return p<60?'low':p<80?'mid':'high'}\nfunction countryName(code){try{return new Intl.DisplayNames([navigator.language||'en'],{type:'region'}).of(code)||code}catch(_){return code||'Unknown'}}\nfunction fillSelect(id,items,labelFn=x=>x,valueFn=x=>x){const el=$(id),cur=el.value,first=el.options[0].outerHTML;el.innerHTML=first+items.map(x=>`<option value=\"${esc(valueFn(x))}\">${esc(labelFn(x))}</option>`).join('');if([...el.options].some(o=>o.value===cur))el.value=cur}\nfunction cascadeLocation(){if(!options)return;const country=$('country').value,region=$('region').value;const locs=options.locations||[];const regions=[...new Set(locs.filter(x=>!country||x.country===country).map(x=>x.region).filter(Boolean))].sort();fillSelect('region',regions);if(region&&regions.incl